// @run
// @log true
// @log false
// @log true
// @log false
// CONTRACT (must-not-error): the equality capability check that a generic call site applies under
// substitution rejects only a GENUINE cross-type compare, so the same generic stays instantiable
// at every type that IS mutually compatible with itself — i32, string, f64, boolean here. This is
// the accepting half of `equality-hole-operand-reject.vl`: the check must not collapse into
// "equality over an un-annotated parameter is suspect".
function same(a, b) a == b

print(same(1, 1))
print(same("a", "b"))
print(same(2.5, 2.5))
print(same(true, false))
